  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "John VanDerbeek was an American property investor based in Washington State. Trained in finance, economics and law, he owned small businesses and managed residential and commercial properties for more than three decades. Alongside his investment work, he served as president of the Holland Society of New York and supported cultural preservation.",
